UML Component Diagram for Self-Service Coffee Kiosk System

Components:
1. User Interface - Handles touchscreen interactions and user input
2. Order Manager - Processes orders, manages order flow
3. Payment Service - Handles credit card payment processing
4. Receipt Printer - Generates and prints receipts
5. Database - Stores menu data, pricing, and order information

Interfaces:
- User Interface → Order Manager: orderSubmission (provided)
- Order Manager → Payment Service: paymentRequest (provided)
- Order Manager → Receipt Printer: receiptGeneration (provided)
- Order Manager → Database: dataAccess (provided)

Data Flow:
- User selects coffee type and size via touchscreen
- Order submitted to Order Manager
- Order Manager processes order and requests payment
- Payment Service processes credit card payment
- Order Manager requests receipt generation
- Receipt Printer prints receipt
- Order Manager queries Database for menu/pricing information